    PMS -->|creates alias| AE

    IPS -->|PubmedPaperEntity + alias| PE
    IPS -->|creates alias| AE

    FOP -->|creates + alias| IE
    FOP -->|enqueues enrichment| PEV

    GT -->|counts| AE
    CLR -->|clears| AE

    SE -->|count| TRC
    PE -->|count| TRC
    IE -->|count| TRC

